Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

data/RNA_PCA_5/ contains a PCA-reduced derivative of published single-cell
RNA-seq data, redistributed with attribution:

  - Embryoid-body scRNA-seq: Moon et al., "Visualizing structure and transitions
    in high-dimensional biological data," Nature Biotechnology 37 (2019).
    Data: Mendeley v6n743h5ng.
  - PCA-embedded artifact (eb_velocity_v5.npz): Tong et al., "TrajectoryNet: A
    Dynamic Optimal Transport Network for Modeling Cellular Dynamics," ICML 2020.
    Code MIT-licensed (https://github.com/KrishnaswamyLab/TrajectoryNet).

See data/README.md for details. All other data artifacts in data/ are simulated
in this repository and are covered by the repository's Apache-2.0 license.
